{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-19","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","englishTitle":"If, as a whole is to a whole, so is a part subtracted to a part subtracted, the remainder will also be to the remainder as whole to whole.","book":5,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","contentId":"euclid-5-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"70bbefe5f4b6f142fa9a8eebdc70e2573eee841a9f7f91ee124068a1f1cac6e2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-19.statement","euclid-5-19.proof.1","euclid-5-19.proof.2","euclid-5-19.proof.3","euclid-5-19.proof.4","euclid-5-19.proof.5","euclid-5-19.proof.6","euclid-5-19.proof.7","euclid-5-19.conclusion","euclid-5-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35308911df1fbd8e47e7910c4bc5141911f4bd75e04523731b4ed1e9dcc376db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If, as a whole is to a whole, so is a part subtracted to a part subtracted, the remainder will also be to the remainder as whole to whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果整体与整体之比等于部分减去一部分之比,则其余部分也等于整个其余部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6cca9bdd570aa7aa50d793517c8b077bdfb541021a01c39ee3468b005de85b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, as the whole AB is to the whole CD, so let the part AE subtracted be to the part CF subtracted; I say that the remainder EB will also be to the remainder FD as the whole AB to the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB是全部CD,所以,让AE部分减为CF部分;我说,其余EB也将减为FD,AB至CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9f9dbd23c6a90fb641a6deaa28e1c97c7ba8ce9ca9a447e3e5b936359df9f02","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as AB is to CD, so is AE to CF, alternately also, as BA is to AE, so is DC to CF. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,AB对CD的比等于AE对CF的比,而BA对AE的比等于DC对CF的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 AE 与 CF 之比；BA 与 AE 之比等于 DC 与 CF 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb223a447e679bddb821e882534c2d40461bd1fbe6cbb8365ae63940ef79d2d7","citations":["euclid-5-17","euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the magnitudes are proportional componendo, they will also be proportional separando, [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)] that is, as BE is to EA, so is DF to CF, and, alternately, as BE is to DF, so is EA to FC. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于星系为成比例 合比, 也为成比例 分比, 即BE -EA 的比等于 DF -CF 的比, 反过来, BE DF -DF 的比等于 EA FC 的比；BE 与 EA 之比等于 DF 与 CF 之比；BE 与 DF 之比等于 EA 与 FC 之比。 [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)] [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e82e5b8187790b21ce07fb341734efc4bd401a39acdd9e3823a0f6ad37dfd1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AE is to CF, so by hypothesis is the whole AB to the whole CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是，按照假设，AE 与 CF 之比等于整个 AB 与整个 CD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0e4b1dddf2e9bdfd4114e9a23ebacb8e0c980136339fda5a347d59ea877c452","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also the remainder EB will be to the remainder FD as the whole AB is to the whole CD. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余EB将占其余FD,因为整个AB占全部CD。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"301ab6694a0a0717fb33b03dc43955953b0bdc9e476a5edc9dd5b99d60953fca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. ["},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bf65daf95fafd5816c5b217cb7cc41b58194278e7bff5dee4082594b3098408","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if magnitudes be proportional componendo, they will also be proportional convertendo."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"推论,从这一点来看,很明显,如果星系是成比例 合比,它们也将是成比例 合比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3401ac2606606290c83b9b6e8a6103ccfc3df1bc45656741e123a47ae852203c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-19.source","contentId":"euclid-5-19","revisionId":"euclid-5-19@raw-70bbefe5f4b6f142","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1954637ddd2a2c891450461800bf73858f46c8acf2608bb1b027230c5ca89e16","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-19